Github actions Yaml file
1) Name: CI/ CD or DevSecOps Pipeline 
2) On:
     push:
      branch:[]
      ignore files:[]
     pull request:
      branch:[]
3) Jobs: 
     test:
     steps included in the job
     static code analysis:
     steps included in the job
     build:
     steps included in the job
